# E.V.A. Backend

Before editing, read `.cursor/skills/eva-backend/SKILL.md`.
Platform specs: `.cursor/skills/eva-specs/SKILL.md`.

## Quick rules

- Layers: `domain` → `definition` → `runtime` → `app` / `workers`
- Tools: one package per tool under `tools/<name>/`
- Import tools via package: `from tools.telegram import TelegramTool`
- Do not import from removed flat modules (`telegram_tool.py`, `polza_client.py`, etc.)
- New tool: package + `__init__.py` exports + catalog + loader registration

## Verify

```bash
docker compose run --rm backend pytest tests/ -q
```
